low_and_patterns.fix:
@cache caches the STATEFUL tree-sitter Parser as a process-global; Parser
is not thread-safe. Cache only the immutable Language; create/threadlocal
the Parser per parse(). Signature/output unchanged.

layers.layer:
Constraint + integrity: UNIQUE (task_id, step_index) idempotency; the
append-only UPDATE-block triggers (and the DELETE decision from B-21);
WAL + BEGIN IMMEDIATE serialization under the fixed connection model;
ledger reserve/commit/release invariants; foreign-key cascade behavior.
A lightweight query-cost check on the summary aggregate (post B-15).

architecture_rules.r:
AUDIT-LOGGED: an audit_log table (actor, action, target, ts, request_id);
        one row per admin request. Column redaction map: api_keys.key_hash and any
        secret is NEVER returned by any admin view.

required_sections.s:
User isolation + org/tenant extension + where it
        breaks — consolidate the two divergent treatments (§4 and §11) into one;
        surface the ADR-0002 "same-UID-on-disk, not full OS compromise" limit.
